# The verification workspace is byte-sensitive.
#
# sources.jsonl records a hash for every snapshot, and claims.jsonl binds each
# claim to an exact quoted substring inside one. If git rewrites line endings on
# checkout, the hashes stop matching and the gate fails on a fresh clone for a
# reason that has nothing to do with the research. Preserve bytes exactly.
.research/snapshots/** -text
.research/*.jsonl       -text

# Rendered output.
*.pdf  binary
*.html text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
